# Each order in which the source may list its keys is an arm of its own.
# RUN: walk f2 mechanisms=all
# CHECK: = HasKeyOrder {{*}} fields=[2]
# RUN(BOTH): walk f2 mechanisms=all
# BOTH: = HasKeyOrder {{*}} fields=[1, 0]
# RUN(ASSIGN): walk f4 mechanisms=all
# ASSIGN: = HasKeyOrder {{*}} fields=[2]
# RUN(ASSIGNBOTH): walk f4 mechanisms=all
# ASSIGNBOTH: = HasKeyOrder {{*}} fields=[1, 0]
# An object that lists other names has its properties defined in each arm.
# RUN(DEFINE): walk f5 mechanisms=all
# DEFINE: PropDefine {{*}} key="key"
# RUN(DEFINEBOTH): walk f5 mechanisms=all
# DEFINEBOTH: PropDefine {{*}} key="id"
# RUN(ANSWERS): run-in-shell mechanisms=all
